8%; V2 +1.69; V3 +1.26; V6 bias -0.0012 (-0.12 pts/100), R2 0.0323, win-side 61.9%, model>actual 47.5%.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "At 520 matchups / 69,876 poss the signal is -0.12 pts/100 and R2 0.03.", "observed_sample_and_power": "520 matchups, 69,876 possessions", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_method": "V1-V5: 240 matchups, 23,922 poss; V6: 520 matchups, 69,876 poss (season_engines); bias, MAE, RMSE, R2, win-side accuracy."}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-017"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-020"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-066", "label": "Study family SF-APPS-066: Brown DRIVE -> Tatum PNR sequential-premium placebo", "score": 0.328, "reached_via": ["request matches RQC:RQC-039 (0.66); FAM:SF-APPS-066 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-039"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Brown DRIVE -> Tatum PNR sequential-premium placebo", "auto_outcome_status": "artifact", "observed_hypothesis": "The reported +0.326 Brown->Tatum PNR premium is Brown-specific, not any-teammate DRIVE->Tatum PNR.", "observed_result": "Reproduced premium +0.3262 n=43 vs Tatum PNR baseline 1.0459. Brown-other gap +0.3185, MW p=0.1702. Placebo 95% [-0.1389,+0.4192], observed inside, p=0.1136; perm p=0.2034. League teammate-DRIVE->PNR controlled beta=+0.0 [cut; read_family for the full text]", "auto_failure_mechanism": "C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Brown-specific +0.326 does not survive placebo; any teammate's DRIVE produces a comparable number. League effect is +0.02 PPP.", "auto_confidence": "high (0.95)"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:PLACEBO_DEPENDENCE"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}, {"rel":